  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"w-full\">\n   <div class=\"relative w-full\" style=\"--hero-aspect-ratio:16/9;--hero-aspect-ratio-mobile:3/4\">\n    <div data-section-header=\"true\" class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\">\n     <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-span-8 toc-visible:@md:col-start-1\">\n      <div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n       <div data-article-hero-copy-region=\"meta\" class=\"mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center\">\n        <p class=\"text-meta text-primary-100\">October 6, 2026</p>\n        <a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-meta text-primary-60 hover:text-primary-100\" href=\"https://openai.com/news/company-announcements/\">Company</a>\n       </div>\n       <div></div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\">\n    <div data-show-toc=\"true\" class=\"col-span-full w-full min-w-0 md:col-span-10 md:col-start-3\">\n     <div class=\"toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] pt-20 w-full\">\n      <div data-article-hero-copy-region=\"support\" class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 flex w-full items-center justify-between border-t border-t-primary-4 pt-3\">\n       <div class=\"flex gap-4 ms-auto\">\n        <div class=\"relative\">\n         <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\">\n          <span class=\"text-cta\"> \n           <button type=\"button\" class=\"transition duration-short ease-curve-a rounded-[2.5rem] text-nowrap min-h-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-[0.3em] text-cta focus:outline outline-offset-2 h-[2.5rem] text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 disabled:text-primary-44 focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-primary-44 px-0 !rounded\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n             <path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M4.52 7.62a.875.875 0 0 1 1.244 1.232L4.67 9.957l-.003.003c-1.384 1.385-1.421 3.658.147 5.227 1.568 1.568 3.842 1.531 5.227.147l.002-.002 1.107-1.095a.875.875 0 0 1 1.231 1.243l-1.106 1.096c-2.105 2.1-5.485 2.062-7.698-.152s-2.251-5.592-.15-7.697z\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M11.881 6.881A.876.876 0 0 1 13.12 8.12l-5 5a.876.876 0 0 1-1.24-1.24z\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M8.726 3.425c2.105-2.1 5.485-2.063 7.698.15s2.252 5.594.15 7.699L15.48 12.38a.875.875 0 0 1-1.244-1.231l1.095-1.107.003-.002c1.384-1.385 1.421-3.659-.147-5.227s-3.842-1.53-5.227-.147l-.003.003-1.106 1.095a.876.876 0 0 1-1.23-1.244z\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path>\n            </svg>\n            Share\n           </button> \n          </span>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\">\n   <nav aria-label=\"Table of contents\" data-show-toc=\"true\" class=\"sticky top-header-h z-50 col-span-full -mx-6 h-0 w-[calc(100%+2*(--spacing(6)))] -translate-y-px transition duration-medium md:hidden opacity-0\" inert>\n    <div class=\"relative mx-auto w-(--document-width) border-b border-primary-4 bg-secondary-100\">\n     <div class=\"force-show-scrollbars relative mx-auto w-full overflow-auto xl:max-w-container-desktop\">\n      <button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex h-toc-button-h w-full px-6 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 focus-visible:outline-primary-100\"><span class=\"truncate pe-5 text-xs leading-tight text-primary-100\">Connecting OpenAI models with enterprise knowledge</span></button>\n      <button inert type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close table of contents\" class=\"absolute inset-e-6 -top-px z-10 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-primary-100 pointer-events-none\"></button>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </nav>\n   <div data-toc-content=\"\" class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] in-data-article-contained:flex in-data-article-contained:flex-col col-span-full min-w-0 md:row-start-1\">\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Atlassian and OpenAI are expanding their partnership, bringing frontier models in the GPT‑6 family across Atlassian’s platform to power AI experiences that help teams plan, build, and deliver work. The combination of both companies’ capabilities will give joint customers more ways to work with Atlassian products and OpenAI.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Under a new agreement, OpenAI frontier models will power agents across Atlassian’s platform and Rovo. Rovo combines OpenAI intelligence with Atlassian’s Teamwork Graph, an enterprise context layer that connects people, projects, documents, and decisions, giving AI a deep understanding of how a company works.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>The expanded partnership builds on a collaboration that began in 2023 and arrives as Atlassian broadens its own adoption of Codex and ChatGPT Enterprise. More than 3,000 Atlassian developers use Codex across their terminals, IDEs, and code review workflows. Through Atlassian plugins powered by the Teamwork Graph, Codex users can access relevant work items and technical documentation, helping developers write, test, and ship software.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>The agreement gives Atlassian expanded access to the latest OpenAI frontier models, including GPT‑6 Astra and the GPT‑5.6 series, as OpenAI continues to advance model capabilities, efficiency, and price-performance.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6 py-8\">\n     <section class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\">\n      <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1\">\n       <div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-carousel-view\" class=\"md:hidden\">\n        <div class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 relative rounded-md border shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgb(0_0_0/0.08)]\">\n         <div class=\"px-6 pb-8 pt-28\">\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-e-6 z-2 flex justify-end top-8\">\n           <div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-controls\" class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"text-meta text-primary-60\">1 of 2</span>\n            <div class=\"flex\">\n             <button type=\"button\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 focus:outline-primary-44 text-btn-media-label\" disabled aria-label=\"Previous testimonial\">\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\">\n               <use href=\"/icons/cms/ca3293544676ab4c/arrow-left-lg.svg#size-16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></use>\n              </svg>\n             </button>\n             <button type=\"button\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 text-primary-60 hover:bg-primary-4 hover:[&amp;&gt;svg]:opacity-60 focus:outline-primary-44 -ms-1 active:scale-95\" aria-label=\"Next testimonial\">\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\">\n               <use href=\"/icons/cms/ca3293544676ab4c/arrow-right-lg.svg#size-16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></use>\n              </svg>\n             </button>\n            </div>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n          <div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-scroll-region\" class=\"no-scrollbar relative scroll-smooth overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden overscroll-x-contain\">\n           <div class=\"sticky inset-s-0 top-0 w-full\">\n            <figure aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"row-start-1 gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] opacity-100\">\n             <blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\">\n              <span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><i><span>Uniting OpenAI frontier capabilities with Atlassian’s Teamwork Graph brings deep organizational context to enterprise work. As we build our open platform, this expanded partnership gives our customers a seamless way to ground the world’s leading models directly in their day-to-day.</span></i>”\n             </blockquote>\n             <figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\">\n              <i><span>—Jamil Valliani, Head of Product, AI at Atlassian</span></i>\n             </figcaption>\n            </figure>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"relative mt-3 overflow-hidden\">\n         <ul class=\"relative flex\" style=\"width:100%\" aria-label=\"Testimonials\">\n          <li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 50%\">\n           <button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"true\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Jamil Valliani\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4 text-primary-100 md:text-primary-60\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Jamil Valliani</span></button>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 50%\">\n           <button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Nikunj Handa\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Nikunj Handa</span></button>\n          </li>\n         </ul>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>As the partnership grows, OpenAI will continue to rely on Jira to help manage critical workflows across the company. Together, the companies aim to bring frontier intelligence into the tools businesses already use, making AI agents a natural part of how teams get work done.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16\">\n     <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] toc-content-heading scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" id=\"connecting-openai-models-with-enterprise-knowledge\">\n      <div class=\"full-grid-content:@md:col-span-full full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2\">\n       <h2 class=\"text-h3 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\"><span>Connecting OpenAI models with enterprise knowledge</span></h2>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Through OpenAI APIs, Atlassian can bring new reasoning capabilities directly into Rovo as models advance, giving customers access to increasingly capable AI within the tools they already use.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>For example, a product manager preparing for a launch could ask Rovo whether the team is on track. Drawing on the Teamwork Graph, Rovo can connect Jira tickets, Confluence documents, and relevant discussions to identify engineering blockers, flag missed milestones, and surface decisions that need attention. OpenAI models help turn that information into a clear assessment of launch readiness and recommended next steps, so teams spend less time piecing together information and more time moving work forward.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>The collaboration also extends beyond Atlassian’s own products. Through the Atlassian and Teamwork Graph CLI plugins for ChatGPT and Codex, customers can connect ChatGPT and Codex to their existing workflows, giving AI access to relevant project information, documentation, and development context, subject to appropriate permissions.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>More recently, Atlassian launched its </span><a href=\"https://community.atlassian.com/forums/discussion/3288784/bring-your-atlassian-work-into-chatgpt-and-codex\" class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>plugin extension</span></u>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> that brings Jira work items, Confluence content, and people directly into ChatGPT and Codex prompts. Its pinned Atlassian Home also surfaced assigned work, recent Looms, projects, and Bitbucket pull requests, helping teams access relevant context and take action.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16\">\n     <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] toc-content-heading scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" id=\"building-toward-the-next-generation-of-ai-powered-teamwork\">\n      <div class=\"full-grid-content:@md:col-span-full full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2\">\n       <h2 class=\"text-h3 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\"><span>Building toward the next generation of AI-powered teamwork</span></h2>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>The companies are exploring deeper integrations with Jira that would make it easier for teams to assign work to AI agents, track progress, capture decisions, and review results. Paired with DX, Atlassian’s platform for measuring developer productivity and engineering performance, these capabilities could help engineering leaders measure AI’s impact on development speed, cycle time, and developer experience while keeping humans in control.</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <section id=\"citations\" data-testid=\"citations\" class=\"w-full scroll-mt-anchor-offset\">\n   <div class=\"rounded-md bg-primary-4 py-8 md:py-16 toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 px-5 col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2\">\n     <section class=\"w-full\">\n      <ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\">\n       <li><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 block rounded-xl bg-primary-4 px-3 py-2! text-nav hover:bg-primary-12\" href=\"https://openai.com/news/?tags=2026\">2026</a></li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <div data-testid=\"author-list\">\n      <h2 class=\"mb-3 text-p2 text-primary-60\">Author</h2>\n      <div class=\"text-p2\">OpenAI</div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"w-full\">\n   <div class=\"mb-8 flex items-baseline justify-between\">\n    <div>\n   